Id: squid003w
Severity: WARN
Category: services
Check: check_squid
Fix: chmod 600 the configuration, or move the password to a file root alone reads.
References: squid.conf.documented
Controls: CIS 3.3, 5.2; NIST AC-3, IA-5(7); ISO 5.17, 8.3; CE User access control

The proxy config holds a password and anyone can read it. Whoever
copies it manages the cache or logs in as the peer. Leave it
readable by root alone.
